<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI11-BLOCKING-02-HTTP-CONTRACT-GENERIC>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI11-BLOCKING-02-HTTP-CONTRACT-GENERIC" ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-Legacy ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-21T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:title "HTTP response always status 200; missing detail/read routes documented in OpenAPI" ;
  triage:description "Post-merge audit of integrate/phase-AI (quality-mgr + qa-triage independent confirmation). Two defects in HTTP API contract enforcement: (1) write_http_response (crates/atm-core/src/api.rs:107-114) hardcodes literal 'HTTP/1.1 200 OK' regardless of envelope content/error state, contradicting openapi.yaml documented 200/201/204 statuses and error-response handling contract. (2) ApiRequest::matches_route (api.rs:264-284) has no matching case for GET /v1/atm/message/{id} detail route or /v1/atm/message/{id}/read route, despite both documented in openapi.yaml. Note: /v1/atm/teams route removal is already an accepted waiver (openapi_surface_reviewed_removals.json); this finding addresses only the missing detail/read routes and always-200 status bug, which are NOT in that allowlist. Sprint-ai-9.md Deliverable 2 requires HTTP API contract parity with OpenAPI spec." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "api-contract-violation" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crate" ;
  triage:status "fixed_partial" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI11-BLOCKING-02/pAI-11/1>, <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI11-BLOCKING-02/pAI-11/2> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-integrate/8d0ccf01> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s20/bed07594> ;
  triage:highestOpenBranch "feature/pAI-s20-hermes-bridge-deployment" ;
  triage:highestFixedBranch "none" ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-21T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:reviewedBy "qa-triage", "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:notes "Post-merge audit finding. Scope: crates/atm-core/src/api.rs (response encoding, request routing). Issue 1: write_http_response must emit correct status per ResponseEnvelope variant. Issue 2: ApiRequest::matches_route must include pattern matches for /v1/atm/message/{id} and /v1/atm/message/{id}/read routes. Waiver check: openapi_surface_reviewed_removals.json allowlists only /v1/atm/teams deletion, not these routes. STALE-POINTER FIX (2026-07-22 sweep): promoteTo/highestOpenBranch previously targeted feature/pAI-s11-post-merge-remediation, which merged (PR #607). Re-verified against current integrate/phase-AI: Issue 1 (hardcoded 200 OK) IS fixed -- write_http_response_body now derives status/reason from encode_response(response) rather than a literal 'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'. Issue 2 is NOT fixed -- decode_route_request (api.rs) still has no match arms for GET /v1/atm/message/{id} or /v1/atm/message/{id}/read. Status updated from open to fixed_partial to reflect Issue 1's resolution; redirected to the current highest open branch, feature/pAI-s20-hermes-bridge-deployment, for the remaining missing-routes half." .

